            {
                "comment": "His lectures are a bit of hand waving and confusing at times, but he would always answer questions when approached. Very proof-heavy lecture style, but the homework was fair and TAs were also very helpful. Exams not designed for you to fail, unlike other sections, and are based off the homework.",
